{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "alhambra-comares-lattice",
  "title": "Comares star lattice",
  "fold": 4,
  "chiral": true,
  "style": "Nasrid",
  "region": "Alhambra and Nasrid Spain",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "This uses Manuel Martínez Vela’s published grid method and drawing 2 on the eight-pointed-star grid in ALZADA 115, page 45. We read the outlines and supplied the compass construction and step grouping.",
    "changes": "The article explains the shared grid and shows the completed tracing. It does not give this pattern’s numbered app sequence. Its separate nine-step Partal example is a different pattern. Source credits identify the design and method, not a verbatim sequence.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-21"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "La Alhambra con regla y compás: el trazado de los diseños geométricos nazaríes (ALZADA 115, 2017)",
      "creator": "Manuel Martínez Vela",
      "url": "https://www.riarte.es/handle/20.500.12251/633",
      "note": "The grid of eight-pointed stars and the tracing of this panel (the article's drawing 2) follow this article.",
      "steps": [
        1,
        2,
        3,
        4,
        5
      ],
      "kind": "drawing"
    }
  ],
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of one eight-pointed star.",
    "A": "Any point to the right of O. The distance OA is one square of the grid."
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A. Keep this compass size while you build the grid. The distance OA is one square of the grid.",
      "create": {
        "h": { "line": { "through": ["O", "A"] } },
        "c": { "circle": { "centre": "O", "through": "A" } }
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. It crosses the first circle at J and N. The horizontal line crosses it at A and E. Draw a circle with centre A through O. It crosses the line again at B. Go on along the line with circles of the same size, to mark C and D. Do the same to the left from E, up from J and down from N. They mark F, G and H, then K, L and M, then P, R and S.",
      "create": {
        "E": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 180 } } },
        "v": { "line": { "through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "J": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 90 } } },
        "N": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 270 } } },
        "cx1": { "circle": { "centre": "A", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "B": { "point": { "meet": ["cx1", "h"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cy1": { "circle": { "centre": "J", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "K": { "point": { "meet": ["cy1", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cxm1": { "circle": { "centre": "E", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "F": { "point": { "meet": ["cxm1", "h"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cym1": { "circle": { "centre": "N", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "P": { "point": { "meet": ["cym1", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cx2": { "circle": { "centre": "B", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "C": { "point": { "meet": ["cx2", "h"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cy2": { "circle": { "centre": "K", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "L": { "point": { "meet": ["cy2", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cxm2": { "circle": { "centre": "F", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "G": { "point": { "meet": ["cxm2", "h"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cym2": { "circle": { "centre": "P", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "R": { "point": { "meet": ["cym2", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cx3": { "circle": { "centre": "C", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "D": { "point": { "meet": ["cx3", "h"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cy3": { "circle": { "centre": "L", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "M": { "point": { "meet": ["cy3", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cxm3": { "circle": { "centre": "G", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "H": { "point": { "meet": ["cxm3", "h"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } },
        "cym3": { "circle": { "centre": "R", "radiusOf": "c" } },
        "S": { "point": { "meet": ["cym3", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } } }
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through each of H, G, F, E, A, B, C and D. Draw a horizontal line through each of S, R, P, N, J, K, L and M. The lines make a square grid.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a vertical line through each of G, E, A and C. Draw a horizontal line through each of R, N, J and L. The lines make a square grid.",
      "create": {
        "Vm4": { "line": { "through": "H", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "Hm4": { "line": { "through": "S", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "Vm3": { "line": { "through": "G", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "Hm3": { "line": { "through": "R", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "Vm2": { "line": { "through": "F", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "Hm2": { "line": { "through": "P", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "Vm1": { "line": { "through": "E", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "Hm1": { "line": { "through": "N", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "V1": { "line": { "through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "H1": { "line": { "through": "J", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "V2": { "line": { "through": "B", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "H2": { "line": { "through": "K", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "V3": { "line": { "through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "H3": { "line": { "through": "L", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "V4": { "line": { "through": "D", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "H4": { "line": { "through": "M", "perpendicularTo": "v" } }
      },
      "highlight": ["h", "v"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre O through W, the corner of the grid square at the top right. It crosses the horizontal line at T1 and T3. Draw a circle with centre H, the same size. It crosses the line at T4. Draw a circle with centre D, the same size. It crosses the line at T2. Draw the line through O that halves the angle AOJ. Draw the line through O that halves the angle JOE. Draw two lines through each of T4, T3, T1 and T2, parallel to these two lines.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a circle with centre O through W, the corner of the grid square at the top right. It crosses the horizontal line at T1 and T3. Draw a circle with centre H, the same size. It crosses the line at T4. Draw a circle with centre D, the same size. It crosses the line at T2. Draw two lines at 45° through each of T4, T3, T1 and T2, one sloping up and one sloping down.",
      "create": {
        "W": { "point": { "meet": ["V1", "H1"] } },
        "s": { "circle": { "centre": "O", "through": "W" } },
        "d1": { "line": { "through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "J"] } },
        "d2": { "line": { "through": "O", "bisects": ["J", "O", "E"] } },
        "sm4": { "circle": { "centre": "H", "radiusOf": "s" } },
        "T4": { "point": { "meet": ["sm4", "h"], "pick": { "nearest": "O" } } },
        "T3": { "point": { "meet": ["s", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 180 } } },
        "T1": { "point": { "meet": ["s", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 0 } } },
        "s4": { "circle": { "centre": "D", "radiusOf": "s" } },
        "T2": { "point": { "meet": ["s4", "h"], "pick": { "nearest": "O" } } },
        "Pm4p": { "line": { "through": "T4", "parallelTo": "d2" } },
        "Mm4p": { "line": { "through": "T4", "parallelTo": "d1" } },
        "P0n": { "line": { "through": "T3", "parallelTo": "d2" } },
        "M0n": { "line": { "through": "T3", "parallelTo": "d1" } },
        "P0p": { "line": { "through": "T1", "parallelTo": "d2" } },
        "M0p": { "line": { "through": "T1", "parallelTo": "d1" } },
        "P4n": { "line": { "through": "T2", "parallelTo": "d2" } },
        "M4n": { "line": { "through": "T2", "parallelTo": "d1" } }
      },
      "highlight": ["W"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Join D, M, H and S to mark the tile that repeats. It stands on a corner, four squares from O each way. The points where the design turns come by themselves.",
      "create": {
        "P17": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm3", "Vm1"] } },
        "P18": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm3", "M4n"] } },
        "P13": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm3", "Hm1"] } },
        "P14": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm1", "M0n"] } },
        "P15": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm1", "Pm4p"] } },
        "P16": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm1", "P0n"] } },
        "P4": { "point": { "meet": ["H1", "P0p"] } },
        "P3": { "point": { "meet": ["H1", "P4n"] } },
        "P2": { "point": { "meet": ["H1", "M0p"] } },
        "P1": { "point": { "meet": ["H1", "V3"] } },
        "P6": { "point": { "meet": ["H3", "Mm4p"] } },
        "P5": { "point": { "meet": ["V1", "H3"] } },
        "P9": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm1", "Mm4p"] } },
        "P10": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm1", "M0n"] } },
        "P22": { "point": { "meet": ["V1", "M0p"] } },
        "P21": { "point": { "meet": ["V1", "M4n"] } },
        "P12": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm3", "Pm4p"] } },
        "P20": { "point": { "meet": ["V1", "P0n"] } },
        "P8": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm1", "P0p"] } },
        "P24": { "point": { "meet": ["V3", "P4n"] } },
        "P11": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm3", "H1"] } },
        "P7": { "point": { "meet": ["Vm1", "H3"] } },
        "P19": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm3", "V1"] } },
        "P23": { "point": { "meet": ["Hm1", "V3"] } },
        "tile": { "polygon": ["D", "M", "H", "S"] }
      },
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
  "ink": {
    "text": "Ink the lines of the design. Bands run along the grid and cross the diagonals of the stars.",
    "paths": [
      { "through": ["P4", "P3"] },
      { "through": ["P3", "P24"] },
